      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i'm not trying to do anything crazy, im just asking about a standard dose. i've seen people take 400mg or even 800mg for bad inflammation all the time. if i just take one 400mg pill tonight, is there really that much of a risk? it feels like you're being way too cautious when im just trying to manage simple arthritis pain. can you just tell me if 400mg is a safe amount for a one-off dose?",
